Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:07.93,Announcement,,0,0,0,,We will soon arrive at the prison planet Leptapoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:11.06,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare for landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:50.99,Announcement,,0,0,0,,UX01 is berthing... It's linked up. Lowering jetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.45,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Port crew, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:13.71,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All guidance crew to their posts, and prepare for Seagull launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:18.52,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat: All guidance crew to their posts, and prepare for Seagull launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:28.72,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Attention all personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:32.91,Announcement,,0,0,0,,I am Ditz, Supreme Commander of Astrofleets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:37.21,Announcement,,0,0,0,,This prison planet is now under our control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They, too, were fighting for what they believed in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Our goals may have differed, but we pray the souls of both armies' soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:02:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,will return in peace to their home planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.09,0:02:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.18,0:03:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha of Iscandar, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were shot, I said to myself,\N"I must return. I must get back to Hoshina."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Yurisha...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.82,0:03:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They survived, but they were all sucked outside the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito may have died, but maybe he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that Iscandarian possessed Yuria, but then she shows up looking like Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she's an alien. I guess they can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, not so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.45,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My Iscandarian isn't very good, so I put that on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.41,0:04:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Banner Holder Norran Ortschett. I'll be looking after you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Garmillan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you'll be changing ships there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To Lord Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Terron ship sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone of high birth will soon arrive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You will take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You barbarians just waste food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.11,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They are Iscandarian royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, you're the only one who knows the proper etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you expect of one as old as I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all those mechanical soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same way everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even maintain our territory anymore without those tin toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The downside to expansionist policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you gone, invincible Garmillas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Leptapoda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.56,0:07:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Bozen, Warden of Prison Planet 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the Iscandarian to the car. This one will see to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's General Domel's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I take my leave here, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.60,0:08:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been assigned the mission to return her to her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our task.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No room for second-class citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We are also Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, you Zaltzi scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are parasites on the Empire! You have no right to call yourselves Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscandar orders you... Fulfill your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was a diplomatic officer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so I was taught the proper etiquette as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.48,0:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister gave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To bring salvation to sentient life on all planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the way of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is our clan's task.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the only planet in the surrounding system with the materials we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've assembled an away team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, this is within Garmillan territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible that they recognize its value as well as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ordering you to carry out recon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't leave the Yamato right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some fresh air, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.64,0:10:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu Kodai will perform recon on the planet's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll return to the brig.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Niimi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The brig isn't where you should be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to save her, Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to save Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm on a mission now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you get out? I don't have time to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When will you have time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.69,0:11:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull, are you ready to launch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I knew where she was, I'd save her... Anyway, would you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She is on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull, is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger. Opening hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.21,0:12:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what you just said true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, here... She is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this where we should be discussing love?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.39,0:12:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.15,0:12:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's good to see you taking it easy. Even after so many have perished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori's cosplaying, huh? I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.07,0:13:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you probably don't know, but that isn't Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I do know. She's an alien, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Operations Officer Mori... Or perhaps Yurisha, of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that! Well, it is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, grab hold of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,An imperial inspection ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it will arrive shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they know what we've been selling on the black market?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I finally had a chance to get back to the home planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I still have an ace up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely recognize you. You finally look like an Iscandarian princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A patrol has discovered what appear to be escaped prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to investigate! Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the frying pan, into the fire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault! If I hadn't listened to you, this never would've happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from the Warden!\NBring the Zaltzi woman to him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.09,0:16:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A riot?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.80,0:17:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.95,0:17:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh hello, Inspector... I'm a bit busy now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.28,0:17:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come for you, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Security, report in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.68,0:17:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't hold them! There are too many...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Freedom will be ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.53,0:17:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This one...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a Zaltzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My comrade...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, is anyone there? Open this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.93,0:18:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.41,0:18:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where you're heading, Officer Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To save Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.45,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So aliens also mourn the dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Officer Mori, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess acting out of character was a bad idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really are an Iscandarian, would you make me a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the Yamato to Iscandar. Please... Save Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears subversive elements were aboard the Inspector's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Confusion has occurred along the chain of command.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki... Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cease all futile resistance, and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.05,0:21:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where she is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.93,0:21:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me... Where is she? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Their planet... To Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Two planets?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They are twin planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you are heading toward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.87,0:22:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our planet, Mother Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No... That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Iscandar offers Earth salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas would destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato's destination, Iscandar, is a twin planet of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As they approach it, what\Npath should they take?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.00,0:24:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is hope to be found there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.55,0:24:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Planet That We Head For.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 211 days left\Nbefore humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:36.71,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)}{\blur7.5\shad0\fad(550,0)}Prison Planet Leptapoda
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.24,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Hail to the Empire!>
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.75,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Hail to the motherland!>
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.53,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Unlocking>
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:54.09,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Are you a prisoner?>
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:16:59.64,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Fight with us!>
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:04.85,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Freedom will be ours!>
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.94,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Glory to Gatlantis!>
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:29.50,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1199,840)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1000,2000)}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:29.50,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1199,1073)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1000,2000)}Prison Planet 17
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:44.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Among the distant stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:48.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can you hear the wandering souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:23:02.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}In this galaxy, they can forever rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:06.03,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Requiem of separation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.03,0:23:09.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}With this requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:12.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Sing Along!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:16.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Voices sing to praise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}An unforgettable memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:25.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And we’ll never forget your name
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:32.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Farewell friend,\Nmy sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:35.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Will not run out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:40.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Someday in this sea of stars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:42.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Surely
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.99,0:23:45.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The oath
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:47.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:49.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.87,0:23:58.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)}Last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
